{"timestamp": "2026-08-05T21:05:37.733178Z", "level": "INFO", "logger": "pamo_sql", "message": "Stage 4 Complete. Final SQL selected: SELECT s.School\nFROM schools s\nJOIN frpm f ON s.CDSCode = f.CDSCode\nWHERE f.[Percent (%) Eligible Free (K-12)] > 0.1\nAND s.NCESDist IN (\n    SELECT d.NCESDist\n    FROM satscores st\n    JOIN schools d ON st.cds = d.CDSCode\n    WHERE st.NumGE1500 >= 1500\n);"}
