{"timestamp": "2026-08-05T21:09:15.114172Z", "level": "INFO", "logger": "pamo_sql", "message": "Stage 4 Complete. Final SQL selected: SELECT s.School, s.FundingType\nFROM schools s\nJOIN frpm f ON s.CDSCode = f.CDSCode\nJOIN (\n    SELECT cds, AVG(AvgScrMath) AS AvgMathScore\n    FROM satscores\n    GROUP BY cds\n) ss ON s.CDSCode = ss.cds\nWHERE s.City = 'Riverside' AND ss.AvgMathScore > 400;"}
