{"timestamp": "2026-08-05T21:28:20.587269Z", "level": "INFO", "logger": "pamo_sql", "message": "Stage 4 Complete. Final SQL selected: SELECT s.School, s.DOCType\nFROM frpm f\nJOIN schools s ON f.CDSCode = s.CDSCode\nWHERE f.`Charter Funding Type` = 'Locally funded'\nGROUP BY s.School, s.DOCType\nHAVING ABS(f.`Enrollment (Ages 5-17)` - f.`Enrollment (K-12)`) > \n       (SELECT AVG(ABS(f2.`Enrollment (Ages 5-17)` - f2.`Enrollment (K-12)`))\n        FROM frpm f2\n        JOIN schools s2 ON f2.CDSCode = s2.CDSCode\n        WHERE f2.`Charter Funding Type` = 'Locally funded');"}
